<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8019] During rebalancing checkpoint read lock is acquired for each entry (twice).</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8019</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In GridDhtPartitionDemander.preloadEntry(...) checkpointReadLock is acquired twice, which is definitely a mistake. But even acquiring it once per entry causes unnecessary contention - it should be taken once for SupplyMessage.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
